Lakṣmaṇa bids Sumantra yoke the chariot --- Lakṣmaṇa tells Sītā of royal Gaṅgā order --- Delighted Sītā packs gifts for sage wives --- Sītā marks throbbing eye and void earth --- Sītā prays for Rāma kin city and creatures --- Party halts overnight by Gōmatī --- Lakṣmaṇa reaches Gaṅgā and weeps aloud --- Sītā urges crossing to greet seers and return --- Lakṣmaṇa wipes eyes and fetches boat